		<p class="Tablefootnotef" style="margin-top: 0in;  border: none; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: -5pt; margin-left: 24.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24.0pt; padding: 0in; font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPSStd-Regular; color: black;">____________</p><p class="Tablefootnote_f" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:10pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;">(1)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>Effective January&#160;1, 2021, Mr.&#160;Lorber began service as Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, and Ms. McMillan began service as Chief Financial Officer. The salaries of Mr.&#160;Lorber and Ms. McMillan were paid pursuant to the employment arrangements with such individuals and the Company.</p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(2)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>Amounts shown reflect amounts earned under the 2023 LTIP Awards based on completion of the 2023 LTIP Plan performance cycle on September&#160;30, 2025.</p>
		<p class="H2" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Chief Executive Officer Pay Ratio</span></p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">For the fiscal year ended September&#160;30, 2025, the median of the annual total compensation of all employees of the Company (other than our CEO) was $460,227, and the total compensation of our CEO was $2,607,492 for the fiscal year. Based on this information, our CEO&#8217;s 2024 annual total compensation was approximately 5.67 times that of the median of the 2025 annual total compensation of all of our employees.</p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">We selected September&#160;30, 2025 as the date used to identify our &#8220;median employee&#8221; who represents the median annual total compensation of all our employees (other than our CEO). As of September&#160;30, 2025, our employee population consisted of six individuals, all located in our New&#160;York office. We calculated the annual total compensation of our employee population in accordance with the requirements of Item&#160;402(c)(2)(x)&#160;of Regulation&#160;S<span class="nobreak">-K</span>, which included salary and bonus.</p>
		<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="ecd:PvpTableTextBlock" id="ixv-1699"><p class="H2" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Pay Versus Performance</span></p></ix:nonNumeric>
		<ix:continuation continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_2" id="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">In accordance with the final rule adopted by the SEC in August&#160;2022 implementing Section&#160;953(a)&#160;of the Dodd<span class="nobreak">-Frank</span> Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act&#160;of&#160;2010, we are providing the following table that sets forth certain compensation measures for certain of our officers alongside certain performance metrics for the Company and industry peers:</p></ix:continuation>
		<ix:continuation continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_3" id="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><table class="No-Table-Style _idGenTablePara-1" style="width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px solid #000; border-width: 0pt; margin: 10pt 0 3pt 0;">	<tr class="No-Table-Style _idGenTableRowColumn-11" style="height:12pt;">	<td class="TCH" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:4pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:2pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;width: 7.92%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;" valign="bottom">	</td>	<td class="TCH" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:4pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:2pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width: 1.13%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;white-space: nowrap;" valign="bottom">&#160;</td>	<td class="TCH" colspan="2" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:4pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:2pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width: 11.89%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;" valign="bottom">&#160;</td>	<td class="TCH" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:4pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:2pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width: 1.13%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;white-space: nowrap;" valign="bottom">&#160;</td>	<td class="TCH" colspan="2" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;bor